// The application icon, compiled into modrunner.exe.
//
// Windows takes the lowest-numbered ICON resource as the icon a program shows
// in Explorer, on the taskbar and in its title bar, so this one is 1. There is
// no VERSIONINFO here on purpose: it would carry a version number that has to
// be kept in step with the changelog by hand, and the icon is what was missing.
//
//   llvm-rc /fo ModRunner.res ModRunner.rc
//
// llvm-rc ships with the Swift toolchain, so this needs no Visual Studio.

1 ICON "ModRunner.ico"
